  "title": "Vertiv honors 2024 North American partners for driving growth and AI innovation",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today announced the winners of its 2024 North America Partner Awards, recognizing 11 standout channel partner organizations for their performance, innovation, and commitment to delivering Vertiv solutions across industries. The honorees were selected based on 2024 performance data, year-over-year growth, and contributions to customer success.",
